From a8bd9a52953b674d7fb39f7c033d933fc7ee8517 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hades-playerinfo: the pages of Hades for other skins follow
 the new panel of Estuary

system/hades/DialogHadesPlayerInfo.xml and HadesIncludes.xml are made from
Estuary's files by make-playerinfo.py. The script knew two pages (overview
and Dolby Vision) in two groups; Estuary's panel is now one group with five
pages and their tabs, so the script takes the panel whole, leaving out only
the page of live TV (Kodi's PVR) and its tab. The textures are the ones that
the new panel uses (the tick, the "i" and the exclamation mark of Estuary's
own media; the two of the old translucent panel are not used any more and go).
---
